# Check order: price, qty, type combination, duplicate id, then type-specific checks.
N 1 1 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 0 5
# A market order must carry price 0.
N 2 2 1 B MKT IOC 0 CN 100 5
N 3 3 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 0
# Qty is checked before the type combination.
N 4 4 1 B MKT GTC 0 CN 0 0
N 5 5 1 B MKT GTC 0 CN 0 5
N 6 6 1 B MKT FOK 0 CN 0 5
N 7 7 1 B MKT IOC 1 CN 0 5
N 8 8 1 B LMT IOC 1 CN 100 5
N 9 9 1 B LMT FOK 1 CN 100 5
N 10 10 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 5
# Type combination is checked before the duplicate id.
N 11 10 1 S MKT GTC 0 CN 0 5
N 12 10 2 S LMT GTC 0 CN 105 5
# Duplicate id is checked before NO_LIQUIDITY (asks are empty).
N 13 10 2 B MKT IOC 0 CN 0 1
C 14 99
C 15 10
